      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so my doctor put me on quetiapine for my anxiety/sleep stuff but im still having a really hard time falling asleep at night. i was thinking of maybe adding some melatonin or even a bit of benadryl to help me knock out since the quetiapine isn't quite doing it yet. is that safe to mix them?",
